      <description><![CDATA[
            <div class="content-box" id="content">
                <style>     div[type]{-webkit-border-radius: 4pt; border-radius: 4pt;overflow:hidden;}     div[type] img{ -webkit-border-radius: 4pt;border-radius: 4pt;}     p{font-family:'苹方','PingFang','\82f95b9','微软雅黑','Microsoft YaHei','XinGothic-SinaWeibo', helvetica, arial, sans-serif;} 	.initFade{ 	    -webkit-transition:opacity 1s; 	    -o-transition:opacity 1s; 	    transition:opacity 1s; 		opacity:0; 	}     .jijin{margin-top: 1.222em !important;padding-bottom: 0.333em;}.jijin_img{display: block;}h3+p{line-height: 12px !important;padding: 4px !important;margin: 0 !important;overflow: visible;}h3+p span{height: 1.72em;line-height: 1.72em;top: 0;}style+p{margin-top: 1.139em;}style+div[type*='GIF'],style+div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.222em !important;}div + div[type*='GIF'], div + div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.778em !important;}div[type*='GIF']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} div[type*='IMG']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} body,p{text-align: justify;line-height: 1.72em !important;} p{word-wrap: break-word;overflow:hidden;max-width:100%;word-break: normal !important;margin: 1.44em 0;}.img-info{font-size:0.8333em;line-height:1.53333em!important;text-align:left;color:#999;margin:1.0666em 0 -0.29833em;}   .sub-tlt{position:relative;font-weight: bold;text-indent:0.7777em;}   .sub-tlt:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0.86em;width:0.333em;height:0.333em;background:#333;-webkit-transform:translateY(-50%);transform:translateY(-50%)}.img-info + div[type*='GIF'],.img-info + div[type*='IMG']{margin: 1.777em auto 0 !important;}</style><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.8" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260926/202609260059379622.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260926/202609260059379622_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260926/202609260059379622_720.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【战报新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-26/match1949131date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">齐祖开门红！法国1-0土耳其 姆巴佩破门+伤退 奥利塞献助攻</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.65" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260926/zhanbao_image_1949131_1790369214_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.65" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.65" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260926/zhanbao_image_1949131_1790369214_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260926/zhanbao_image_1949131_1790369214_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>姆巴佩破门后伤退，法国1-0客场击败土耳其，齐达内迎来执教法国国家队的开门红。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-26/match1949130date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">曼奇尼回归首秀告负！比利时2-0意大利 霍茨破门卢克巴基奥世界波</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.63" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260926/zhanbao_image_1949130_1790369248_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.63" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.63" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260926/zhanbao_image_1949130_1790369248_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260926/zhanbao_image_1949130_1790369248_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>霍茨、卢克巴基奥建功，意大利0-2不敌比利时，曼奇尼回归执教意大利首秀告负。</p><p><strong>【曼城115项指控基本成立】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-25/6ab67a3f2ae54native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">重磅！DO独家：曼城115项指控已做出裁决，除1项外其余全部成立！</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260925/202609252210352723.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260925/202609252210352723.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260925/202609252210352723.jpg"> </div><p>大卫·奥恩斯坦（DO）消息，关于曼城此前遭到的115项指控，除其中一项外，其余指控全部被裁定成立！</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-25/6ab6817ee7884native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">曼城若被剥夺冠军最终英超冠军归属：曼联2冠、利物浦1冠</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250304/67c614352ff65.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250304/67c614352ff65.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250304/67c614352ff65.jpg"> </div><p>曼城在2009/10至2017/18赛季期间遭到指控，多家媒体表示曼城甚至可能被剥夺冠军。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-25/6ab6885551281native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记者：英超其余19队已被告知曼城被判有罪，曼城计划提出上诉</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.51" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_240520/664b692dd5429.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.51" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.51" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_240520/664b692dd5429.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_240520/664b692dd5429.jpg"> </div><p>记者Alex Crook与Ben Jacobs报道，英超其余19队已被告知曼城将被裁定有罪。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-25/6ab68d0346b4anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">独立报：曼城有可能被逐出英超吗？是的，制裁可含罚款+扣分+除名</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.6" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_200530/5ed2315a5e0d2.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.6" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.6" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_200530/5ed2315a5e0d2.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_200530/5ed2315a5e0d2.jpg"> </div><p>曼城被曝115项财务违规指控中有114项成立，英媒《独立报》指出，曼城被逐出英超的可能是存在的。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-26/6ab6bc185777anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">TA：曼联评估因曼城违规可能造成的财务损失，包括错失的冠军等</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.9" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260926/202609260223512018.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.9" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.9" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260926/202609260223512018.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260926/202609260223512018.jpg"> </div><p>The Athletic报道，曼联已就俱乐部因曼城违反英超财务规定而可能蒙受的经济损失规模进行了内部评估。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-26/6ab6ca1baff2dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">TA：英超球队计划对曼城违规采取法律措施 可能变成集体诉讼索赔</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260926/202609260323431998.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260926/202609260323431998.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260926/202609260323431998.jpg"> </div><p>The Athletic报道，英超俱乐部正计划采取法律行动，以回应曼城被认定在几乎所有涉及违反联赛财务规定的指控中均有罪。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-26/6ab6c58579fa6native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">电讯报：若曼城被剥夺全部冠军，红军曼联各拿3座英超国米1座欧冠</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_210330/606338a1b5c2b.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_210330/606338a1b5c2b.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_210330/606338a1b5c2b.jpg"> </div><p>电讯报撰文分析，若曼城被剥夺全部冠军奖杯，其他球队能分到哪些荣誉。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-26/6ab6d270dfbfanative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">曼城将被裁定违规，德赫亚发文：那我到底赢了多少个英超冠军？</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="2.31" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260926/202609260358481781.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="2.31" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="2.31" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260926/202609260358481781.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260926/202609260358481781.jpg"> </div><p>多家英媒消息，曼城此前遭到的115项指控除其中一项外，其余指控全部被裁定成立。德赫亚发文谈及曼联可能受到的影响。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-25/6ab68bbbe476cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">114项指控被判有罪！曼城本赛季从英超降级概率短时间内激增至16%</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-25/6ab68fb3f2963native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">太阳报：曼城若被重罚恐出售球星，哈兰德50万镑周薪合同剩8年</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-25/6ab69439c7d77native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">清算时间！曼城官方社媒被球迷攻陷：作弊的**种，冠军还给我们！</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-26/6ab6a062aa6fbnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">又来补刀了！费迪南德：吉格斯本该拥有14座英超冠军奖杯😭😂</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-26/6ab6a139ebe7cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">ESPN：曼城周五申请了禁令，试图阻止媒体对判决结果的初步报道</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-26/6ab6e377bebc0native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗德里谈曼城违规：我们的成就不是靠钱买来的，相信俱乐部清白</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-26/6ab6ee7e6de71native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">太阳报：曼城可能本赛季扣80分，往年再追溯扣分，四队已准备索赔</a></p><p><strong>【其它新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-26/6ab6ea0a66281native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：姆巴佩遭遇肌腱损伤，将缺席法国队剩余比赛</a></p><p>法国队官方消息，姆巴佩因伤将提前返回皇马。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-26/6ab6bfc31002fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">图赫尔：多次征召帕尔默但他还是来不了，我不花精力在没来的人上</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.83" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260926/202609260239435547.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.83" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.83" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260926/202609260239435547.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260926/202609260239435547.jpg"> </div><p>英格兰主帅图赫尔接受ITV专访，聊到多名英格兰球员的相关话题。</p><script> 	$(function(){ 	    $(".video-bg").find('span').click(function(){/*视频播放*/             var _this = this;             var index = $(".video-bg span").index(this);             var MediaArr = document.getElementsByTagName("video");             $(this).parent().hide();             MediaArr[index].play();             MediaArr[index].controls = true;             $(".video-box").each(function(i, item) {                 if ($(this).find('span').get(0) !== _this) {                     $(this).find('.video-bg').show();                     MediaArr[i].pause();                     MediaArr[i].controls = false;                 }             })         });  	if(typeof(canLoadImage)=='function'){/*新版图片打开方式定义*/ 		if(!((typeof(getNetType)==='function' && getNetType()) || canLoadImage())){             $(".img_wrap").css('background-color', '#D9D9DA').find('.play_btn').css('text-indent','0');         } 		var platform = $('input[name="platform"]').val(); 		platform = platform=='ios'?'ios':'android'; 		var img_op = img_op_value = ''; 		function show_small_gif1(){ 			$(".img_wrap").each(function(i){ 				img_op = get_img_op_attr($(this),platform); 				img_op_value = get_op(img_op,platform); 				var lineHeight = $(this).find('.play_btn').height();  				if((img_op_value==1||img_op_value==2||img_op_value==3||img_op_value==4||img_op_value==7)&&$(this).attr("data-thumb")!=''){ 				    $(this).css('background-image',"url('"+$(this).attr("data-thumb")+"')"); 				    $(this).find('.play_btn').html('').css('font-size','3em').css('color','white').css('line-height', lineHeight + 'px').css('background', 'url(https://static4style.duoduocdn.com/common/img/ic_gif_big@3x.png) no-repeat center center').css('background-size','104px'); 				} 			}); 		}  		setTimeout(show_small_gif1(),100); 		/*load_type 1=wifi,2=4G&&loadimg,3=4G&&noloadimg*/ 		function load_img(this_obj,load_type,status) { 			img_op = get_img_op_attr(this_obj,platform); 			img_op_value = get_op(img_op,platform); 			/*var img = this_obj.children('img:first');*/ 			var img = this_obj.find('img:eq(0)'); 			if(load_type==1){ 				if(img_op_value==1 || img_op_value==7){ 					if(img.attr('t-rc')==img.attr('src')){ 						open_img(img_op_value,platform,img.attr('t-rc')); 					}else{ 						this_obj.find('.play_btn').hide(); 						img.attr('src', img.attr('t-rc')); 					} 				}else if(status==1){ 					open_img(img_op_value,platform,img.attr('t-rc')); 				} 			}else if(load_type==2&&this_obj.attr('type')=='IMG'){ 				this_obj.find('.play_btn').hide(); 				img.attr('src', img.attr('t-rc')); 			} 			if(typeof(getJSType)=='function' && getJSType()){                 img.load(function(){                     window.webkit.messageHandlers.imageLoaded.postMessage('test');                 }); 			}else if(platform=='ios'&&typeof(imageLoaded)=='function'){ 				img.load(function(){ 				    /*加载完成*/                     imageLoaded(); 				}); 			} 		}; 		 		var ms = 1000; 		if(platform === 'android'){ 		    ms = 10; 		} 		setTimeout(function(){ 			if(typeof(getNetType)=='function' && getNetType()){/*wifi*/ 			$(".img_wrap").each(function(i){ 				load_img($(this),1,0) 				}); 			}else{ 				if(canLoadImage()){/*载入图片*/ 					$(".img_wrap").each(function(i){ 						load_img($(this),2,0) 					}); 			}else{ 				$(".img_wrap").each(function(i){ 					load_img($(this),3,0); 				}); 			} 			} 		}, ms);  		$(".img_wrap").click( 				function(){ 				    var jumpUrl = $(this).attr('jump-url');                     if(jumpUrl){                         return openLink(jumpUrl);                     } 					load_img($(this),1,1); 					event.stopPropagation(); 				} 			); 		$('a').click(function(e){ 			img_op = get_img_op_attr($(this),platform); 			img_op_value = parseInt(get_op(img_op,platform)); 			if(img_op_value>=0&&img_op_value<=7){ 				open_img(img_op_value,platform,$(this).attr('href')); 				if ( e && e.preventDefault ) 					e.preventDefault(); 				else 					window.event.returnValue = false;  				return false; 			}     	}); 	}else{/*旧版本*/ 		function show_small_gif(){ 			$(".img_wrap").each(function(i){ 				/*console.log($(this).css('background-image'));*/ 				$(this).find('.play_btn').css("text-indent","0"); 				if($(this).attr("data-ratio") && /gif/i.test($(this).attr("type")) ){                     var ratio = $(this).attr("data-ratio");                     $(this).css({width:"100%",height:0,"padding-top":100/ratio+"%"}).find(".play_btn").css({top:0,height:'100%'});                 } 				if($(this).attr("data-thumb")!=''){                     $(this).append('<img class="img-thumb" style="position: absolute;top: 0;left: 0;width: 100%;height: 100%;object-fit: cover;" src="'+ $(this).attr("data-thumb") +'" />'); 					$(this).find('.play_btn').html('').css('font-size','3em').css('color','white').css('background', 'url(https://static4style.duoduocdn.com/common/img/ic_gif_big@3x.png) no-r